sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Plugin pipeline when an opportunity is won
  accDescr: A synchronous PreOperation plugin runs inside the transaction and can roll back the win; after commit, an asynchronous PostOperation plugin runs through the async service.
  autonumber
  actor U as Sales user
  participant D as Dataverse platform
  participant Pre as PreOperation plugin (sync)
  participant DB as Database transaction
  participant Q as Async service
  participant Post as PostOperation plugin (async)
  U->>D: Close as Won (WinOpportunity)
  D->>+DB: Begin transaction
  D->>+Pre: Execute (stage 20)
  alt validation fails
    Pre-->>D: InvalidPluginExecutionException
    D->>DB: Roll back
    D-->>U: Error dialog
  else validation passes
    Pre-->>-D: Target updated
    D->>DB: MainOperation (stage 30) writes opportunity
    DB-->>-D: Commit
    D-->>U: Opportunity won
    D-)Q: Queue system job (stage 40)
  end
  par async work
    Q->>+Post: Execute
    Post->>D: Create follow-up project
    Post-->>-Q: Completed
  and user continues
    U->>D: Open next record
  end
